notes.content:
Hi!
Thanks for feedback from our community, we've improved some mechanics:
- Added hints and videos;
- Fixed a bug with adding units to a group;
- Accelerated animation of resource collection;
- Added notification of enemy attacks and destruction of barricades;
- Highlighting resources when approaching them;
- Fixed some bugs with sounds.

Now we will be constantly updating and improving the demo.

That's all for now! If you have any questions or suggestions, you can join our Discord or Steam community!


